1
00:00:06,442 --> 00:00:08,713
There is one thing effort cannot do.

2
00:00:08,793 --> 00:00:11,312
It cannot produce what
is already complete.

3
00:00:12,121 --> 00:00:15,519
The natural state is not
produced by stopping thought.

4
00:00:15,599 --> 00:00:18,445
It is not achieved by
pushing appearances away.

5
00:00:18,547 --> 00:00:22,625
Thought is recognised as already
empty, already not fixed.

6
00:00:22,705 --> 00:00:25,551
And in that recognition, it stops fixing.

7
00:00:26,357 --> 00:00:28,464
Recognition is the key word.

8
00:00:28,544 --> 00:00:30,720
Lhun grub means already complete.

9
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:36,182
It is not produced by effort, so it is not
a state one gets more of by trying harder.

10
00:00:36,262 --> 00:00:39,891
The moment effortlessness is
treated as an accomplishment,

11
00:00:39,971 --> 00:00:42,486
it has become one more fixed object.

12
00:00:42,566 --> 00:00:46,861
Even the word "effortless" needs
watching. It is recognised.

13
00:00:46,941 --> 00:00:51,009
And the moment it is held as something
to maintain, it has been left.

14
00:00:51,838 --> 00:00:54,326
The same caution applies to negation.

15
00:00:54,406 --> 00:00:59,190
The Middle Way warns that those who
take emptiness as a view are incurable.

16
00:00:59,270 --> 00:01:04,109
A way out that negates appearances
until nothing is left is still a fixer.

17
00:01:04,189 --> 00:01:06,627
It is only working on a different object.

18
00:01:07,429 --> 00:01:11,194
Recognition is different in
kind. It does not negate.

19
00:01:11,274 --> 00:01:14,360
It sees that appearances
are already not fixed.

20
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:16,619
So there is nothing further to do to them.

21
00:01:17,441 --> 00:01:20,526
Madhyamaka draws a
distinction that helps here.

22
00:01:20,606 --> 00:01:24,793
One kind of negation denies,
and puts nothing in its place.

23
00:01:24,873 --> 00:01:28,991
Another kind denies, and installs
a positive ground instead.

24
00:01:29,071 --> 00:01:32,089
Recognition must stay with the first kind.

25
00:01:32,169 --> 00:01:37,374
If "the nature of each appearance"
becomes a ground beneath appearances,

26
00:01:37,454 --> 00:01:41,727
the disease of reification
has returned in a new form.

27
00:01:42,538 --> 00:01:46,562
Practice, then, turns
around three recognitions.

28
00:01:46,642 --> 00:01:48,735
One is that conditions are what work.

29
00:01:48,815 --> 00:01:51,303
Anger is not a thing with its own nature.

30
00:01:51,383 --> 00:01:56,521
It reshapes itself when the attention,
the interpretation and the circumstances

31
00:01:56,601 --> 00:02:01,276
change. Another is that openness
is simply what dependence means.

32
00:02:01,356 --> 00:02:03,926
Practice works because nothing is fixed.

33
00:02:04,006 --> 00:02:06,779
And the last is that
there is nothing to hold,

34
00:02:06,859 --> 00:02:08,912
and no one apart from the holding.

35
00:02:08,992 --> 00:02:11,602
The practitioner is
named on the practising,

36
00:02:11,682 --> 00:02:13,604
and is not found apart from it.

37
00:02:14,438 --> 00:02:15,853
The trap remains.

38
00:02:15,933 --> 00:02:21,220
Openness, non-holding and emptiness
can quietly become the new things held.

39
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:25,771
A state to reach. An attitude
to keep up. A view to defend.

40
00:02:25,851 --> 00:02:28,475
But openness, too, is empty.

41
00:02:28,555 --> 00:02:30,309
It is not something one has.

42
00:02:30,389 --> 00:02:32,923
It is the absence of what one was holding.

43
00:02:33,725 --> 00:02:36,512
Even writing about this
is part of the practice.

44
00:02:36,592 --> 00:02:41,647
Words composed from unresolved grasping
tend to make a reader who grasps at the

45
00:02:41,727 --> 00:02:46,271
words. The most a text can do is
point, and then get out of the way.

46
00:02:47,073 --> 00:02:49,058
So the book ends where it began.

47
00:02:49,138 --> 00:02:53,365
The observer that seemed to stand
behind experience has not been found.

48
00:02:53,445 --> 00:02:56,110
Vividness has been seen without a viewer.

49
00:02:56,190 --> 00:03:01,191
The substrates, the logics and the ways
of seeing have each been looked at.

50
00:03:01,271 --> 00:03:03,895
Each was found to be a
designation that works,

51
00:03:03,975 --> 00:03:05,951
and cannot stand on its own.

52
00:03:06,757 --> 00:03:10,576
And nothing needs to be produced to take
the place of the habit that was seen

53
00:03:10,656 --> 00:03:11,856
through.

